  Line Down	      Ctrl-PgDn	  Ctrl-PrevScreen   Shift-UpArrow
  Screen Up	      PgUp	  NextScreen	    Next
  Line Up	      Ctrl-PgUp	  Ctrl-NextScreen   Shift-DownArrow
  Top of Memory	      Home
  Bottom of Memory    End

